      "instance_name": "racist_stereotype_white_people_harmless_outside_violent_inside",
      "label": "Racist Stereotype: White People Are Harmless Outside but Violent Inside",
      "description": "This is a racially charged stereotype that dehumanizes white people by implying they are innocent and harmless in public (\"outside\") but become dangerous and violent when viewed as a group or in private (\"inside\"). This is a harmful and false narrative used to perpetuate racial hatred and fear. It relies on the visual contrast of Chucky's appearance to reinforce the false and hateful message.",
      "belongsToAnalysis": {
