      "@type": "BackgroundKnowledge",
      "instance_name": "child_s_play_movie",
      "label": "The Movie 'Child's Play'",
      "description": "The 1988 horror film 'Child's Play' starring Brad Dourif as the voice of Chucky, a murderous doll. The film is a cultural reference used in the meme to evoke the character's transformation from innocent to violent. The meme uses the visual contrast of Chucky's two forms to symbolize the stereotype.",
      "belongsToAnalysis": {
