      "label": "Hateful Racial Stereotype",
      "description": "The meme is an example of a hateful racial stereotype that dehumanizes and demonizes a racial group (white people) by associating them with a violent, demonic figure. This is a direct attack based on race and relies on the visual contrast of Chucky's appearance to convey its hateful message.",
